WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.325 --> 00:00:06.274
Today’s task: plot (3, 4), (6, 2) and (6, 7), then connect them.

2
00:00:06.274 --> 00:00:09.745
First set Quadrants to First quadrant. It starts empty.

3
00:00:09.745 --> 00:00:14.313
Tap the grid to plot a point. Points of one color join into a line.

4
00:00:14.313 --> 00:00:16.453
A point in the wrong place? Drag it. It snaps to the grid.

5
00:00:16.453 --> 00:00:19.207
Tap the first point again to close the shape.

6
00:00:19.207 --> 00:00:23.469
Three sides and three corners: the treasure is a triangle.

7
00:00:23.469 --> 00:00:28.623
Undo opens it again. Close the shape in the palette closes it.

8
00:00:28.623 --> 00:00:32.725
The next tap starts a new line, in any color.

9
00:00:32.725 --> 00:00:39.562
Every task has its prompt and a teacher note, below the board.
